{%- comment -%}
  "As seen at" — exhibition/venue credits.                              2026-08-28

  Replaces the plain text line that rendered from section.settings.sites_list:
      "as seen at — Design Museum, London · Musée du Luxembourg, Paris ·
       London Design Festival · Grand Designs Live · UK Bamboo Summit, Coventry"

  LOGOS ARE ONLY USED WHERE THE ASSET ALREADY EXISTS IN THIS THEME. Three do:

      logo-design-museum.svg      Design Museum, London
      logo-luxembourg-museum.png  Musee du Luxembourg, Paris
      logo-grand-designs.svg      Grand Designs Live

  Three do not, and are rendered as styled wordmarks instead:

      London Design Festival     James supplied the artwork 2026-08-28 but the
                                 file was never saved to disk, so there is no
                                 asset to reference yet. Slot is ready.
      Eden Project               workshops delivered there (James, 2026-08-28)
      UK Bamboo Summit, Coventry

  Deliberately NOT sourced from the open web. These are third-party trademarks;
  using the wrong mark on a credibility band is worse than using none, and which
  marks BBC may display is a rights decision, not a build decision. To add either,
  drop the official SVG into assets/ as logo-london-design-festival.svg,
  logo-eden-project.svg or logo-uk-bamboo-summit.svg and move its entry from `wordmarks` to `logos` below.

  Mixing marks and wordmarks in one row is a normal editorial pattern, and the
  shared .bbc-seenat__item sizing keeps the rhythm even.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign seen_label = label | default: 'as seen at' -%}

<div class="bbc-seenat" role="region" aria-label="Exhibitions and events">
  <p class="bbc-seenat__label">{{ seen_label }}</p>
  <ul class="bbc-seenat__row" role="list">

    <li class="bbc-seenat__item">
      <img src="{{ 'logo-design-museum.svg' | asset_url }}"
           alt="Design Museum, London" loading="lazy"
           width="120" height="34" class="bbc-seenat__logo">
    </li>

    <li class="bbc-seenat__item">
      <img src="{{ 'logo-luxembourg-museum.png' | asset_url }}&width=320"
           srcset="{{ 'logo-luxembourg-museum.png' | asset_url }}&width=160 160w,
                   {{ 'logo-luxembourg-museum.png' | asset_url }}&width=320 320w"
           sizes="160px"
           alt="Musée du Luxembourg, Paris" loading="lazy"
           width="160" height="34" class="bbc-seenat__logo">
    </li>

    <li class="bbc-seenat__item bbc-seenat__item--text">
      <span class="bbc-seenat__word">London Design Festival</span>
    </li>

    <li class="bbc-seenat__item">
      <img src="{{ 'logo-grand-designs.svg' | asset_url }}"
           alt="Grand Designs Live" loading="lazy"
           width="130" height="34" class="bbc-seenat__logo">
    </li>

    <li class="bbc-seenat__item bbc-seenat__item--text">
      <span class="bbc-seenat__word">Eden Project</span>
    </li>

    <li class="bbc-seenat__item bbc-seenat__item--text">
      <span class="bbc-seenat__word">UK Bamboo Summit<span class="bbc-seenat__sub">Coventry</span></span>
    </li>

  </ul>
</div>
